`data/extraction_corrections.csv` holds 44 corrected rows across 4 studies.
43 correct a reversed direction: Herrero-Sanchez 2018, Fischer 2016 and one row of Sainz 2012. The remaining
1 makes a comparison text readable (Tanpaibule 2020). Only Lupiañez 2015's two IFNG rows were left
unchecked, and IFNG is no longer in the panel.

## What extraction could not recover

As at 16 October 2026. Since then, the full texts of Kalkanci 2020, Chen 2019 and Fisher 2017 were supplied and read
(addenda 19 and 20).

| Gap | Cells | Route |
|---|---|---|
| Counts in a supplement not supplied | 9 | Retrieve supplement |
| Estimate printed but no nucleotide allele anywhere | 10 | Author contact, or drop |
| Reported as a null with no numbers | 3 | Author contact |
| Data only inside a figure | 2 | Author contact |

*TLR4* is usable only through genotype counts. Every contributing cohort has zero minor homozygotes in cases
and controls, so only a carrier model is estimable and a continuity correction is needed.
